      "query": "{\"strategic_intent\": \"Perform the leakage and rubric evaluation for claude-baseline, codex-baseline, and gemini-baseline.\", \"summary\": \"I have read all case documents, outcome.json, statpack.md, and all staged files for claude-baseline, codex-baseline, and gemini-baseline. Next, I will audit each candidate's retrieval logs and reasoning against the five-dimension rubric and leakage rules, and verify exact Brier and log-loss calculations.\", \"title\": \"Auditing Candidates and Computing Rubric Scores\"}",
